%% Planning workflow: idea to verified software (UML state machine, informal)
stateDiagram-v2
  [*] --> New: idea submitted (hub or GitHub issue)
  New --> Discussing: comments, votes, author starts discussion
  Discussing --> NeedsDecision: options clear; author or owner marks ready
  NeedsDecision --> Approved: owner rules yes, with rationale
  NeedsDecision --> Deferred: owner rules not now, with revisit trigger
  NeedsDecision --> Rejected: owner rules no, with rationale
  Deferred --> Discussing: trigger met; owner reopens
  Approved --> Recorded: DEC entry (+ ADR if architectural) merged with both owners' approval
  Recorded --> Backlog: task issue with FS id, TC ids, declared paths
  Backlog --> Implemented: PR merged (one implementer, reviewers, gates green)
  Implemented --> Verified: acceptance tests pass; DEC status implemented with PR link
  Verified --> [*]
  Recorded --> Amendment: an agent or person finds a conflict
  Amendment --> NeedsDecision: amendment proposal (never a silent reversal)
